    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ものですから: because (with an apology)",
     "texto": [
      "To explain a reason with an apologetic tone: plain-form sentence + **もの です から**: **ねつ が ある もの です から、 やすみます** (because I have a fever, I'm taking the day off).",
      "It's more polite than **〜から**. It's used a lot when apologising or justifying oneself."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜んじゃないか: maybe; isn't it that...?",
     "texto": [
      "In casual conversation, **んじゃないか** is added to verbs and adjectives in the plain form: **あした は あめ が ふる んじゃない か** (isn't it going to rain tomorrow?). With nouns and -na adjectives, **なんじゃないか**. A more formal form is **のではないでしょうか**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
